    <string name="affinity_tastes">Tastes</string>
    <string name="affinity_shared_scores_how" formatted="false">Takes the anime you both scored and measures whether the scores go up and down together (Pearson correlation): 100% when they move the same way on every anime, even if one of you always scores lower. It needs at least two shared anime with a score.</string>
    <string name="affinity_tastes_how">No shared anime needed. For each of you it works out how much you like genres, themes, demographics, studios, source, age rating, type and decade, from how far above or below your own mean you scored the anime that have them; then it compares the two profiles. Only your own scores count, not MAL\'s, and it needs at least 10 scored anime each.</string>
