    <string name="anilist_not_on_anilist_title">Not on AniList</string>
    <string name="anilist_not_on_anilist_body">AniList doesn\'t have these anime of your MAL list as anime of their own, so they stay on MAL only. Sometimes it includes them in another one: an episode 0, say, or the last episodes inside the main series. Mitayo looks for them again every week. Tap an anime for its details.</string>
    <string name="anilist_adult_off">Your AniList account has 18+ content off, and AniList hides adult anime from Mitayo too: that\'s why they look missing. Turn it on in AniList\'s settings and sync: Mitayo looks for them right away.</string>
