    <string name="anilist_link_title">Keep AniList the same as MAL</string>
    <string name="anilist_link_body">MAL stays your account. With AniList linked, Mitayo keeps the two lists the same: what is on one only goes on the other too, missing episodes and scores are filled in, and every swipe reaches both. When they disagree (a different status or score, an anime removed from one), Mitayo stops and asks which one to keep.</string>
